    <item>
      <title>【富可敌国】Aiide AI今日再送100个体验名额，支持sd2.0，happyhorse，glm5.2/gpt/gemini/claude等全模型</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2479967</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2479967</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 07:00:12 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;官网地址：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;onebox allowlistedgeneric&quot; data-onebox-src=&quot;https://www.aiide.com&quot;&gt;
  &lt;header class=&quot;source&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/c/9/e/c9e14b954d6458be4a1fc8431d82d0532c8e3f43.png&quot; class=&quot;site-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;2124E8&quot; width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;500&quot;&gt;

